WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.599 --> 00:00:15.720
go for a walk, Buster," a man said.

2
00:00:16.880 --> 00:00:18.020
He put a leash on his dog.

3
00:00:20.461 --> 00:00:21.281
They went outside.

4
00:00:22.782 --> 00:00:25.202
A big, creepy plant grew in the man's front yard.

5
00:00:25.222 --> 00:00:26.763
"Oh my!"

6
00:00:27.003 --> 00:00:27.423
he said.

7
00:00:27.443 --> 00:00:29.643
"Where did that strange plant come from?"

8
00:00:30.964 --> 00:00:31.764
He stepped closer.

9
00:00:33.780 --> 00:00:35.822
Suddenly the plant opened a large mouth.

10
00:00:38.183 --> 00:00:38.944
"Oh no!"

11
00:00:39.564 --> 00:00:40.485
the man cried out.

12
00:00:42.466 --> 00:00:50.231
Gulp! so glad it's Friday," Mara said.

13
00:00:51.572 --> 00:00:53.514
Roxy and her friends were walking home from school.

14
00:00:53.534 --> 00:00:55.995
"Me too," Jack said.

15
00:00:56.015 --> 00:00:59.418
"I can't believe we had three quizzes in one day."

16
00:01:01.699 --> 00:01:02.800
Suddenly Terrell pointed.

17
00:01:03.560 --> 00:01:04.661
"What is that?"

18
00:01:05.402 --> 00:01:06.062
Everyone looked.

19
00:01:07.243 --> 00:01:09.485
A creepy plant was growing next to someone's house.

20
00:01:09.505 --> 00:01:12.287
"Wow," Mara said.

21
00:01:12.307 --> 00:01:15.490
"That looks like something from another planet."

22
00:01:15.510 --> 00:01:18.993
"There's a plant like that in my backyard," Jack said.

23
00:01:19.013 --> 00:01:20.774
"It's a lot bigger though.

24
00:01:21.134 --> 00:01:22.556
My mom was wondering what it is.

25
00:01:22.976 --> 00:01:24.017
We have a vegetable garden.

26
00:01:24.397 --> 00:01:26.038
But we didn't plant anything like that."

27
00:01:27.359 --> 00:01:29.801
Roxy looked at the plant closely as she walked past it.

28
00:01:29.821 --> 00:01:32.724
"I wonder what kind of plant it is."

29
00:01:33.760 --> 00:01:34.481
Terrell laughed.

30
00:01:35.221 --> 00:01:38.043
"Maybe it's an alien plant!"

31
00:01:38.743 --> 00:01:40.465
He held out his arms to look like claws.

32
00:01:40.485 --> 00:01:42.566
"Look out, Mara!

33
00:01:42.786 --> 00:01:45.548
The alien plant is coming after you!"

34
00:01:46.889 --> 00:01:47.910
Mara rolled her eyes.

35
00:01:47.930 --> 00:01:50.972
"You're ridiculous, Terrell."

36
00:01:52.353 --> 00:01:53.253
Jack kept walking.

37
00:01:53.273 --> 00:01:54.954
"Come on," he said.

38
00:01:54.974 --> 00:01:57.776
"When we get to my house, I'll show you my plant."

39
00:01:59.958 --> 00:02:01.619
A moment later they got to Jack's house.

40
00:02:02.399 --> 00:02:05.085
Jack was right—the plant in his yard was huge.

41
00:02:06.506 --> 00:02:09.429
It had large bulbs and twisting vines that looked like tentacles.

42
00:02:09.449 --> 00:02:12.751
"Yikes!" Mara said.

43
00:02:12.771 --> 00:02:15.394
"You should probably cut that down."

44
00:02:16.514 --> 00:02:17.535
Jack scratched his head.

45
00:02:17.555 --> 00:02:20.257
"I'm afraid to get close to it."

46
00:02:21.038 --> 00:02:21.759
Then he laughed.

47
00:02:22.639 --> 00:02:24.881
"Maybe I can get Rocket Girl to cut it down!"

48
00:02:25.722 --> 00:02:26.863
Terrell and Mara laughed.

49
00:02:30.786 --> 00:02:33.128
"Let's take a closer look," Terrell said.

50
00:02:35.168 --> 00:02:36.749
Just then Roxy's watch beeped.

51
00:02:37.569 --> 00:02:39.930
She waited while her friends walked into Jack's backyard.

52
00:02:39.950 --> 00:02:43.511
"Mayor Bloom," she whispered.

53
00:02:43.531 --> 00:02:45.012
"What's wrong?"

54
00:02:46.252 --> 00:02:47.373
Mayor Bloom looked worried.

55
00:02:47.393 --> 00:02:49.694
"I have a problem, Rocket Girl.

56
00:02:50.154 --> 00:02:52.115
My assistant never came to work today.

57
00:02:52.655 --> 00:02:54.456
Neither did anyone else in my office."

58
00:02:55.896 --> 00:02:56.897
Roxy rubbed her chin.

59
00:02:56.917 --> 00:02:59.318
"Maybe they just wanted the day off."

60
00:03:00.618 --> 00:03:01.639
The mayor shook his head.

61
00:03:01.659 --> 00:03:04.800
"No, they love coming into work.

62
00:03:05.332 --> 00:03:08.416
And Detective Smith told me people keep calling the police station.

63
00:03:09.097 --> 00:03:11.079
They know other people who are missing too."

64
00:03:11.099 --> 00:03:14.643
"Don't worry, Mayor," Roxy said.

65
00:03:14.663 --> 00:03:16.586
"I'm on my way!"
